      "text": "INTERDICTED! On July 19, at approximately 11:05 AM, the Joint Harbor Operations Center in San Diego detected a vessel crossing the Maritime Boundary Line near Point Loma. A San Diego Air and Marine Branch Coastal Interceptor Vessel crew operating in the region quickly responded, and successfully interdicted a 18-foot vessel with three illegal aliens on board who identified themselves as Mexican nationals. The vessel was towed to Ballast Point Naval Base, and the individuals were transferred to Border Patrol for further processing. #BorderSecurity",
